<title>USA: Lowe's August same-store sales rose 12 pct.</title>
<headline>Lowe's August same-store sales rose 12 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH WILKESBORO, N.C. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lowe's Cos Inc Thursday reported sales for the four weeks ended August 30.</p>
<p>	     Sales in millions of dollars     Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $657.9     $518.9	 +27	  +12</p>
<p>The company said management emphasized that the 12 percent comparable store sales increase shown in the table above for 318 stores, reflects all store groups including the Large (more than 80,000 feet) Group. Comparable store sales for August for the Large Group only (129 stores) were up 15.8 percent, continuing their trend of successful performance.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
